cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this repository for the secondary analysis and separately credit the source dataset and studies listed in references.bib."
type: software
title: "ADHD, academic outcomes, and social adjustment: reproducible statistical analysis"
authors:
  - name: "Sinezub2"
    website: "https://github.com/Sinezub2"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sinezub2/adhd-academic-analysis"
url: "https://github.com/Sinezub2/adhd-academic-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Secondary analysis of academic and social adjustment in university students.
  Primary Welch comparisons use published Israeli ADHD-only and comparison-group
  summaries with Holm correction. South African ASRS associations are provisional
  score audits because AAS coding and weighted GPA availability are unresolved.
  Outcomes, diagnoses, symptom severity and study populations remain distinct.
keywords:
  - ADHD
  - academic adjustment
  - social adjustment
  - reproducible research
  - Welch t-test
  - Holm correction
